| Phase | Focus | Deliverable | Status |
|-------|-------|-------------|--------|
| **1 (MVP)** | Snowflake + dbt + heuristic cost | Canonical rule compiler, quarantine table, cost model, manual lineage | **This specification** |
| 2 | Tier 1 streaming | Kafka/Flink schema validation with failure modes | Specified |
| 3 | Active learning (LLM) | Statistical baseline + LLM suggestion + approval queue | Specified |
| 4 | Probabilistic cost | Monte Carlo with incident clustering | Specified |
| 5 | Lineage correlator | OpenLineage + hybrid ranking | Specified |
| 6 | Multi‑warehouse | BigQuery CloudDQ, Databricks expectations compilers | Specified |
| 7 | Control plane resilience | Health checks, staleness detection, circuit breakers | Specified |

All code released under MIT License. No timeline provided.

